{"id":"75bfb365b18a132c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory.md","title":"Beth Definability Theorem","display":"thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory","aliases":["72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory"],"display":"thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.5.6 print58–59/PDF70–71","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; full proof not independently reproduced","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.6 print58–59/PDF70–71"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; full proof not independently reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 的五分量签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_*\">\\(R_*\\)</span> 是新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_R\">\\(\\Sigma_R\\)</span> 是将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_*\">\\(R_*\\)</span> 加入关系分量且指定元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的五分量扩充。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\)</span> 为互异变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_R\">\\(\\Sigma_R\\)</span> 句子集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\\)</span> 为相应约化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_*^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|^n\">\\(R_*^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models A\">\\(T\\models A\\)</span> 表示每个非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_R\">\\(\\Sigma_R\\)</span> 结构若满足所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中句子就满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>结构与满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_R}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models A\">\\(T\\models A\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models_{\\Sigma_R}A\">\\(T\\models_{\\Sigma_R}A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\restriction\\Sigma:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\restriction R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\restriction\\Sigma:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\restriction R\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为原签名的关系分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_*^{\\mathfrak M}:=I_R(R_*)\">\\(R_*^{\\mathfrak M}:=I_R(R_*)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\)</span> 顺序迭代全称构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时为空迭代。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\ ((\\mathfrak M\\models T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models T\\land\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright\\Sigma)\\to R_*^{\\mathfrak M}=R_*^{\\mathfrak N})\\right]\\ \\longrightarrow\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\ ((\\mathfrak M\\models T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models T\\land\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright\\Sigma)\\to R_*^{\\mathfrak M}=R_*^{\\mathfrak N})\\right]\\ \\longrightarrow\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\ (\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land T\\models\\forall\\vec x\\ (R_*(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\theta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\ (\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land T\\models\\forall\\vec x\\ (R_*(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\theta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是理论T在全部模型扩张之间的隐定义，而非在某单个模型内的唯一性。明确θ取自不含新符号的基础语法，替换旧无定义Form_L谓词。来源§2.5.6利用插值证明；只核对完整定理陈述和适用条件，没有重做插值证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 的五分量签名，$R_*$ 是新 $n$ 元关系符号，$\\Sigma_R$ 是将 $R_*$ 加入关系分量且指定元数 $n$ 的五分量扩充。$\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})$ 为互异变量。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"结构与满足关系取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]：$\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N$ 遍历 $\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_R}$，$T\\models A$ 缩写 $T\\models_{\\Sigma_R}A$。$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$ 时，$\\mathfrak M\\restriction\\Sigma:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\restriction R\\rangle$，其中 $R$ 为原签名的关系分量；$R_*^{\\mathfrak M}:=I_R(R_*)$。$\\forall\\vec x$ 按 $x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}$ 顺序迭代全称构造，$n=0$ 时为空迭代。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"R_*","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_R","display":false},{"tex":"R_*","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"R_*^{\\mathfrak M}\\subseteq|\\mathfrak M|^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_R}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"T\\models_{\\Sigma_R}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\restriction\\Sigma:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\restriction R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"R_*^{\\mathfrak M}:=I_R(R_*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\left[\\forall\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak N\\ ((\\mathfrak M\\models T\\land\\mathfrak N\\models T\\land\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak N\\upharpoonright\\Sigma)\\to R_*^{\\mathfrak M}=R_*^{\\mathfrak N})\\right]\\ \\longrightarrow","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{72}(\\Sigma)\\ (\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_i:i<n\\}\\land T\\models\\forall\\vec x\\ (R_*(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\\theta)).","display":true}],"bytes":2375,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory|thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem](72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory|thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory — Beth Definability Theorem]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-433","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-definability-theorem-proof-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}